{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线第一下落在左上方紫色大字“不再需要他陪”，随后自然落到下方同样醒目的灰白色大字“一下安静了”。两行构成主要视觉入口，字号、位置和对比度都明显高于其他文字。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"这个人似乎已经不再需要他的陪伴了。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"安静、平静、情绪收住；是否真正释然不确定。\",\n  \"missed\": \"下方说明中仍然绷着想靠近的劲，并没有真正松开；原本几乎要冲出去的势头突然收住。这种表面安静、内在仍有牵挂的反差，第一眼不容易抓到。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"下方三行说明连续铺开，包含了多层情绪和声音意象，需要进一步阅读才能获得内在情绪的复杂性。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f246c3a2-2066-4024-b431-24d623a32c77", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T020709664891Z", "elapsed_seconds": 31.344, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:07:41.004225+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8511fb36cd27b5a7c1a7c878c642e0c08a3d1acf1136bf492ad71e8c4a1b8610", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa238850000257